    <string name="about">Mi Back Screen %1$s</string>
    <string name="about_message">Shows your own images, GIFs, a clock, a charging animation and your notifications on the Xiaomi 17 Pro Max back screen, moves the app you\'re using there with Quick Switch, and opens Xiaomi Camera there with a swipe.\n\nNo internet permission: nothing leaves your phone.\n\nNot affiliated with Xiaomi.</string>
