    <string name="mirror_options_note">These apply only while an app is on the back screen, and Xiaomi\'s settings are put back when it leaves.</string>
    <string name="mirror_limits_title">Good to know</string>
    <string name="mirror_limits">• With the main screen on sideways, the back screen lights once you turn the phone over or press Power. Touching it before then brings up Xiaomi\'s \"Press the Power button\" message.\n• A video playing full screen may start again from the app\'s home page.\n• The keyboard may open on the main screen.\n• Some video apps show black on a second screen.\n• The main screen stays as it was, and turns off as usual.</string>
