    <string name="camera_close_title">Closing it</string>
    <string name="camera_close">• Swipe in from the back screen\'s right edge, Xiaomi\'s back strip.\n• Cover the camera for a moment.\n• Close camera, here or in the notification.\n• It also closes when the back screen dims.</string>
    <string name="camera_limits_title">Good to know</string>
    <string name="camera_limits">• Xiaomi Camera opens in its own back screen mode, on the main cameras. Photos and videos go to Gallery as usual.\n• While it\'s up, Xiaomi shows its own page on the main screen, and turns the main screen off after about 30 seconds.\n• Xiaomi Camera closes by itself when the back screen isn\'t touched for a while, even while recording. Tap it now and then during a long video.</string>
